.TH PDFLUENT-XFA 1  "pdfluent 1.1.0" PDFluent
.SH NAME
pdfluent\-xfa \- Experimental XFA tooling (feature\-gated, not production\-supported)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpdfluent xfa\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Experimental XFA tooling (feature\-gated, not production\-supported)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Machine\-readable JSON envelope on stdout
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Quiet: human mode prints data only (no warnings or progress notes)
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Verbose stderr diagnostics (repeat for more)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
pdfluent\-xfa\-flatten(1)
Flatten an XFA/AcroForm document (not yet implemented in the public CLI)
.SH VERSION
v1.1.0
